    off:gpcCategoryDescription "Definition: Includes any products that can be described/observed as a preparation containing specific ingredients designed to stimulate or suppress the appetite. These products are not designed to be a replacement for meals. Products also include Fat Burners and Fat Blockers designed to decrease the fat content of the body. Definition Excludes: Specifically excludes all meal replacement products. Excludes products such as Dietary Aids - Appetite and Fat Control products obtained only by prescription or from a healthcare professional and Dietary Aids - Meal Replacements."@en ;
