categories:dough-based-meals-ready a off:Category ;
    skos:broader categories:meals ;
    skos:inScheme off:categories ;
    skos:prefLabel "Dough based meals (ready)"@en ;
    off:gpcCategoryCode "10000299"@en ;
    off:gpcCategoryDescription "Definition: Includes any products that can be described/observed as a savoury dough-based ready to eat, prepared/processed product, such as Pasta, Gnocchi or Noodles, with other ingredients, such as meat, dairy, eggs, fish, vegetables and/or seasoning. An optional seasoning/flavour packet may be present. These ingredients form a valuable part of the product, such as tuna and salad in a Tuna Pasta Salad. They may or may not contain a sauce. These products may have a main component which is considered a meal without any additional components. These products do not require cooking prior to consumption, but some products can be eaten hot after reheating. These products have been treated or packaged in such a way as to extend their consumable life. Includes ready to eat shelf stable Ready-Made Meals where a Dough Based Product is the primary ingredient. Definition Excludes: Excludes Ready-Made Combination Meals. Specifically excludes pizza, savoury pies, pastries, quiches and bread products.Excludes products such as Perishable Ready to Eat and Not Ready to Eat Dough Based Prepared/Processed Products, Unprepared Pasta and Noodles, Dried Pasta and Noodles."@en ;
    off:gpcCategoryName "Dough Based Products / Meals - Ready to Eat - Savoury (Shelf Stable)"@en .

categories:dough-based-meals-variety-packs a off:Category ;
    skos:broader categories:meals,
        categories:variety-packs ;
    skos:inScheme off:categories ;
    skos:prefLabel "Teigbasierte Gerichtemischpackungen"@de,
        "Dough based meals variety packs"@en,
        "Paquetes surtidos de productos y comidas a base de masa"@es,
        "Produits à base de pâte"@fr,
        "Različita pakiranja jela na bazi tijesta"@hr,
        "Confezioni miste di piatti a base di pasta"@it,
        "Assortimenten van maaltijden op basis van deeg"@nl,
        "Packs variados de produtos y refeições à base de massa culinária"@pt ;
    off:gpcCategoryCode "10006222"@en ;
    off:gpcCategoryDescription "Definition: Includes any products that can be described/observed as two or more distinct Dough Based products, sold together, which exist within the schema belonging to different bricks but to the same class, that is two or more products contained within the same pack which cross bricks within the Dough Based Products class. Includes products such as Spaghetti Bolognaise not ready to eat and pasta cheese/sauce ready to eat. Items that are received free with purchases should be removed from the classification decision-making process. Definition Excludes: Excludes products such as Pasta/Noodles Products."@en ;
    off:gpcCategoryName "Dough Based Products / Meals Variety Packs"@en .

