    off:gpcCategoryCode "10000212"@en ;
    off:gpcCategoryDescription "Definition: Includes any products that can be described/observed as an aromatic or richly flavoured vegetable or plant or its derivative that is typically added to season or give additional flavour to foods. These products include aromatic seasonings which are obtained from the bark, buds, fruit, roots, seeds or stems of various plant and known as spices, and those, which are obtained from the leafy part of a plant and known as herbs. Products include unprocessed and processed frozen herbs and/or spices or a combination of frozen herbs and spices. These products must be frozen to extend their consumable life. Definition Excludes: Excludes products such as Perishable Herbs and Spices, Salt and Extracts."@en ;
    off:gpcCategoryName "Herbs/Spices (Frozen)"@en .

