    off:gpcCategoryDescription "Definition: Includes any products that can be described/observed as a thick savoury mixture made from fish, meat, mushrooms or vegetables.Products may be coarsely textured or smooth.These products must be refrigerated to extend their consumable life. Definition Excludes: Excludes products such as Sandwich Fillings, Pastes and Spreads, Frozen and Shelf Stable Pate  and other types of spreadable sausages."@en ;
